      "mergedPostDetails": "Right now, only the legacy InputField can open the VRC Keyboard. Unity 2022 consider non TMP InputField as legacy. It should be posible to allow the TMP version to open it. Aditionaly, expose it to udon, only the legacy one can read/write it, but not for TMP version.",
